    <!--
      Tranche 5B (2026-08-10) — the Active Listing traction monitor behind lwc/listingAlerts.
      ⚠ A PermissionSet deploy REPLACES this file's whole grant list, so an org-side-only class
      access absent from here is destroyed by the next deploy of this file. Reconcile against the
      org before deploying (this bit Broker Protection twice, 2026-08-05 and 2026-08-06).
    -->
    <classAccesses>
